   "widgets_values": [
    "## HD animation\nThe video model animates the art directly (the pixel-animate LoRA is off). Frames are picked (loop point or start→end), cut out with soft edges, stabilised on the feet and saved with one shared crop. APNG keeps full colour and soft alpha; the GIF is a preview."
